{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“难受时想有人陪”强化成“怕孤单到愿意再受那些气”，替人物下了更重的判断，S08的“却不想回头”也略早确定了他的态度。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮抓住每段的关键转折，感受又按音乐时点出现，观众不必同时消化一整堆短词，更容易边听边扫；音乐细节也更具体，情绪变化有了声音、动作和身体感受的支撑。X的完整叙述在人物动机和前后因果上更稳，尤其保留了犹豫背后的复杂性，Y有时为了突出重点而把人物心思说得过满。总体选Y，但它的优势主要在观看体验和感受细腻度，不代表叙事准确性也全面胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "28482da3-33b4-42f5-8332-ab71b0196fe2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062426277691Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:25:24.610781+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6aba29826c02e8e27dfeed165eea8fdc835f83df4690441f1114b90068542e96", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp